WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.090
India is home to 95 percent
of the world's Hindus.

2
00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:08.650
And 99 percent of Hindus live
in the Asia-Pacific region.

3
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.690
Christianity began in the
eastern Mediterranean.

4
00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.000
Today it is the most widely
diffused of all faiths.

5
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:19.290
30.7 percent of Christians
live in sub-Saharan Africa,

6
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.330
and 22.3 percent in Europe.

7
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:26.110
Why does one stay close to
home, while the other spreads?

8
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.430
Is it pure chance?

9
00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.150
Or simply age?

10
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.790
In this mission, you'll map
where major religions began,

11
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.010
from Mecca to Bodh Gaya.

12
00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.370
Then you'll follow how faiths
travel: from rulers downward,

13
00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.730
and from person to person.

14
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:45.630
Your mission: explain why one major
religion is found mostly in one country,

15
00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.430
while another has spread
across every continent.
